    (property "Note" "Ch2 divider lower leg. 2.21/13.21 = 0.1673, so 16.0 V in gives 2.68 V at the ADC and 5.0 V gives 0.836 V -- both inside the 3.1 V the ESP32 ADC can actually use. This value must match the return attenuator below exactly or the ground correction is worse than useless" (at 83.82 136.4 0)
